_{0}=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，R=0.8 得到"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{q}{m}=10^{6}C/kg"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"-qEy = \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 -\\frac{1}{2} mv_0^2"},{"type":"text","value":"得到"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 10^{5}m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"-qBy = mv_{x} - mv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"得到"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = 8\\times 10^{4}m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n离子进入 PQ 右侧时速度与水平方向夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"斜向上或"},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"斜向下"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow T = \\frac {2 \\pi m}{q B} = 2 \\pi \\times 1 0 ^ {- 5} S"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Rightarrow t _ {1} = \\frac {5 3}{9 0} \\pi \\times 1 0 ^ {- 5} S \\quad t _ {2} = \\frac {1 2 7}{9 0} \\pi \\times 1 0 ^ {- 5} S"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"qBL = qEt"},{"type":"text","value":"(2 分)\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{BL}{E} = 2\\pi \\times 10^{-5}S"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"}]}}]}
